      "hasTextLink": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "⚠️ Adoption risk (flagged 13 Jul, still unresolved 14 Jul): Grace indicated\nMacro Frozen may keep using its own pick list instead of this\nMaya PDF flow. Same skepticism echoed on the AR flow below (tb9)\n— run real pick→confirm→upload AND AR cycles before assuming adoption.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠️ Adoption risk (flagged 13 Jul, still unresolved 14 Jul): Grace indicated\nMacro Frozen may keep using its own pick list instead of this\nMaya PDF flow. Same skepticism echoed on the AR flow below (tb9)\n— run real pick→confirm→upload AND AR cycles before assuming adoption.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "rawText": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
