      "text": "⚠️ New 2026-07-14: Grace pushed back on this AR auto-match flow —\nsees it as the same manual work just routed through Maya, not a\nreal time-save. Needs a real-usage check post-go-live, same as\nthe pick-list adoption risk above.",
